## AI Agent Rules

- The human reviews and commits; the agent proposes.
- FlowForge checkpoints are mandatory: CKP-1 (spec), CKP-2 (plan), CKP-3 (verify).
- Documentation is updated in the same PR as the code.
- No architecture decision exists without an approved ADR in `docs/architecture/adr/`.
- Work in progress lives in `.ai-work/{slug}/`; `openspec/` is not used in this project.
- Read this file before reading memory or `.ai-work/` — AGENTS.md is the skill index.

